00:05:55.500 --> 00:06:00.940
very simple reason. Number one, there's a way that you blow the whistle

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:04.380
on waste, fraud, abuse, and illegality. You can go through your chain of

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:09.300
command, or you can go to the media. And this whistleblower, apparently at

