00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:39.860
Oversight Committee, went to the CIA's General Counsel, the lawyers, and

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:44.100
then the lawyers went to the CIA leadership. They came up with something

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:48.180
