00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:51.540
Inspector General, who then instead of going to the Oversight Committee

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:55.420
went to the Justice Department, and the Justice Department deemed it to

00:06:55.420 --> 00:07:01.500
be not credible, and they killed it. Well then Schiff got word that this

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:05.300
whistleblower, quote-unquote whistleblower, had this information, and

00:07:05.300 --> 00:07:10.180
Schiff went public. So I looked at the complaint that came out of the CIA,

00:07:10.180 --> 00:07:13.700
