00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:17.500
whistleblower, because when you're an analyst, like this person

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.300
apparently is, I was an analyst at the CIA for the first eight years of

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:25.620
my career, they send you to their training facility called the Farm, and

00:07:25.620 --> 00:07:30.020
they beat into you over the course of six months the CIA's writing style, so

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:33.100
that when you write for the President's Daily Brief, for the President,

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:36.220
the Vice President, the Secretary of State and Defense, the National

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:41.060
Security Advisor, no matter who writes it, it looks exactly the same,

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:44.780
because everybody's writing in the same CIA writing style. But this

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:49.700
whistleblower complaint is not in that CIA writing style. This is in

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:53.540
a legal writing style, and that tells me that the complaint was not made

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:58.780
